cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "research-log: a skill for auditable, resumable desk research with AI assistants"
abstract: >-
  research-log is a skill for Claude that keeps the methodology documentation
  of a social-science desk-research project complete and current, so that any
  phase can be resumed in a new conversation and the whole project can be
  audited afterwards. It comes with rlcheck, a dependency-free Python script
  that checks task records, tracks the inputs of each task by digest, and
  derives the decisions currently in force.
authors:
  - name: "TC Praha"
version: "2026.11.11"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
repository-code: "https://github.com/bzzzwa/research-log-skill"
url: "https://github.com/bzzzwa/research-log-skill"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - research methodology
  - desk research
  - social science
  - research documentation
  - reproducibility
  - audit trail
  - AI assistants
  - Claude
